{
  "slug": "huggingface-skills",
  "name": "Huggingface Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build, train, evaluate, and use open source AI models, datasets, and spaces.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **25 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (25): `hf-cli` (Hugging Face Hub CLI (`hf`) for downloading, uploading, and managing models, datasets, spaces, buckets, repos, papers, jobs, and…), `hf-cloud-aws-context-discovery` (Discover the user's local AWS context (active profile, region, account ID, caller identity) at the start of any…), `hf-cloud-python-env-setup` (Set up an isolated Python environment for SageMaker / AWS work, with the right Python version and current…), `hf-cloud-sagemaker-deployment-planner` (Plan and coordinate the deployment of a model to Amazon SageMaker AI), `hf-cloud-sagemaker-iam-preflight` (Ensure a usable SageMaker execution role exists before deploying or training), `hf-cloud-sagemaker-production-defaults` (Create a SageMaker endpoint (real-time, real-time scale-to-zero, or async) with autoscaling, CloudWatch alarms, and tagging enabled by default), `hf-cloud-serving-image-selection` (Pick the right serving container for a SageMaker model deployment and find its current image URI), `hf-mem` (Hugging Face CLI to estimate the required memory to load Safetensors or GGUF model weights for inference from…), and 17 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `huggingface-skills`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install huggingface-skills@claude-plugins-official` from `huggingface/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 25,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
